Research question: Can we predict which telecom customers are likely to leave a company?

A telecom company wants to identify customers who may cancel their subscriptions. Your task is to develop a machine-learning model that predicts whether a customer will leave.

You will learn:
- Data cleaning and exploratory data analysis.
- Encoding categorical variables.
- Handling missing values.
- Dealing with imbalanced datasets using SMOTE or class weights.
- Random Forest and XGBoost.
- Model evaluation using precision, recall, F1-score and ROC-AUC.
Expected outcome: A model that predicts customer churn and identifies the factors associated with customer departure.
